note right of DAO6
Owns connection/config, not every business responsibility.
Default constructor owns con; Connection constructor borrows.
Test mode verifies actual catalog before business SQL.
end note
note right of Vehicle6
ID before save is null. Derived getVehicleCode is null-safe.
currentMileage/manufactureYear: Integer nullable.
No physical vehicleCode column.
end note
note right of ServicePartServlet6
Actual sequence: item info -> PAID period history -> lifetime.
Invoice action repeats reads and validates usage membership by Objects.equals.
No rating; back URLs preserve filter/page/usagePage.
end note
note right of Payment6
Optional value object folded into Invoice columns.
UNPAID -> Invoice.payment=null; PAID id logically equals Invoice.id.
Cashier FK on Invoice differs from salesperson FK on RepairOrder.
end note
note right of RevenueStats6
DTO, no table/PK. Counts rows, revenue uses historical prices.
PAID + issueDate; DESC revenue then ASC code/type.
Whole-result BigDecimal total, page size 20.
end note
